{
  "esm": "1.2.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "scale-project-runspec",
    "description": "PLAN.md §7.3.40, step 7f's first RunSpec: `scale-project`, the corpus's one PROJECT-domain run, computed from the DEFAULT DATABASE plus the run's PROJECT input database. It mounts `inputs/washtenaw-project.esm` -- which declares the project's link, its source-type share and the domain, and mounts the default database -- where every other RunSpec here mounts `moves-onroad.esm`; that is the only structural difference, and the selections below are the same ten every RunSpec carries, read from the run's own snapshot.\n\nWHAT THE DOMAIN CHANGES, all of it selected in the model by `run_isProjectDomain` and nothing written here: SHO is ProjectTAG's link volume x source-type share x days x age fraction x the hour's share spent on the link (`act_projectSho`), in place of TotalActivityGenerator's VMT allocation; running exhaust weights its operating modes by LinkOperatingModeDistributionGenerator's distribution for the link (`lomd_W`: the two drive schedules bracketing 30 mph, second by second, five-decimal quotients, interpolated) in place of the average-speed bins'; and MOVESOutput carries the zone and the link.\n\n`n_outputRate` IS 125: one emitted block (9101), 125 cohorts. `run_domainUnported` is the check that the run asks nothing of its domain the model does not do, and it is 0.\n\n`db_movesoutput` is DECLARED AND CONSUMED BY NOTHING, as in every RunSpec here.",
    "authors": [
      "EarthSciML Authors and Contributors"
    ],
    "tags": [
      "fixture",
      "onroad",
      "default-database",
      "project-domain"
    ]
  },
  "data_sources": {
    "db_runspecyear": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../../moves.rs/characterization/snapshots/scale-project/tables/db__movesexecution1ccc0232_campuscluster_illinois_edu__runspecyear.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_runspecyear"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope"
        ],
        "note": "1 row, yearID 2020. The scope comes from these tables and never from the RunSpec XML, whose @key attributes are 0-based indices into sorted ID lists (docs/mixed-onroad.md §0.1).",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_runspecmonth": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../../moves.rs/characterization/snapshots/scale-project/tables/db__movesexecution1ccc0232_campuscluster_illinois_edu__runspecmonth.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_runspecmonth"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope"
        ],
        "note": "1 row, monthID 8.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_runspechour": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../../moves.rs/characterization/snapshots/scale-project/tables/db__movesexecution1ccc0232_campuscluster_illinois_edu__runspechour.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_runspechour"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope"
        ],
        "note": "1 row, hourID 9. `<beginhour key=\"8\">` is a 0-based index into the sorted hour list (docs/mixed-onroad.md 0.1).",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_aggregationhour": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../../moves.rs/characterization/snapshots/scale-project/tables/db__movesexecution1ccc0232_campuscluster_illinois_edu__runspechour.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_aggregationhour"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope"
        ],
        "note": "The hours the run aggregates over. This run does not set `aggregateBy`, so it is `runspechour` itself and the same file.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_runspecday": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../../moves.rs/characterization/snapshots/scale-project/tables/db__movesexecution1ccc0232_campuscluster_illinois_edu__runspecday.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_runspecday"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope"
        ],
        "note": "1 row, dayID 5 (weekday). The second factor of the activity axis and of the output axis, and its extent is one in this run: `<day id=\"5\">` selects one day type where the earlier `<day key=\"5\">` was an out-of-range INDEX and fell back to both (moves.rs PR #55).",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_rateday": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../../moves.rs/characterization/snapshots/scale-project/tables/db__movesexecution1ccc0232_campuscluster_illinois_edu__runspecday.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_rateday"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope"
        ],
        "note": "The day types the RATE-side time pre-aggregation is scoped to. This run does not set `aggregateBy`, so it is `runspecday` itself and the same file: the pre-aggregation averages over one cell and returns the table's own value. A run that aggregates points this somewhere else, because MOVES overwrites `runspecday` with the synthesized output day AFTER the pre-aggregation has run.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_actday": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../../moves.rs/characterization/snapshots/scale-project/tables/db__movesexecution1ccc0232_campuscluster_illinois_edu__runspecday.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_actday"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope"
        ],
        "note": "The day types the output day's ACTIVITY covers. This run does not set `aggregateBy`, so it is `runspecday` itself and the same file, and `noOfRealDays` is that one day type's.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_runspecsourcetype": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../../moves.rs/characterization/snapshots/scale-project/tables/db__movesexecution1ccc0232_campuscluster_illinois_edu__runspecsourcetype.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_runspecsourcetype"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope"
        ],
        "note": "1 row, sourceTypeID 21.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_runspecroadtype": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../../moves.rs/characterization/snapshots/scale-project/tables/db__movesexecution1ccc0232_campuscluster_illinois_edu__runspecroadtype.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_runspecroadtype"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope"
        ],
        "note": "1 row, roadTypeID 4. J27: this is the join that suppresses every process-2 row, because start exhaust lives on the off-network road type 1 and the RunSpec does not select it (§0.2).",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_runspecsourcefueltype": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../../moves.rs/characterization/snapshots/scale-project/tables/db__movesexecution1ccc0232_campuscluster_illinois_edu__runspecsourcefueltype.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_runspecsourcefueltype"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope",
          "cohorts"
        ],
        "note": "4 rows: source type 21 with gasoline, diesel, E85 and electricity -- the RunSpec names gasoline alone and MOVES widens it.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_movesoutput": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../../moves.rs/characterization/snapshots/scale-project/tables/db__out_scale_project__movesoutput.parquet"
      },
      "reader_options": {
        "float_columns": [
          "emissionQuant"
        ]
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "oracle",
          "expected-output"
        ],
        "note": "The 125-row expected output, pollutant 91, process 1, link 1 in zone 261610, road type 4, 41 model years over four fuels. DECLARED AND CONSUMED BY NOTHING; compare-output.py reads it directly under tolerance.toml.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_runspecpollutantprocess": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../../moves.rs/characterization/snapshots/scale-project/tables/db__movesexecution1ccc0232_campuscluster_illinois_edu__runspecpollutantprocess.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_runspecpollutantprocess"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope"
        ],
        "note": "2 rows: 9101 (Total Energy x Running Exhaust) and 9102 (Total Energy x Start Exhaust). The RunSpec XML also names Fossil Fuel Energy, 93, which MOVES does not carry into the execution database; and 9102 writes its rates on the off-network road type, which the RunSpec does not select, so one block reaches MOVESOutput.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_runspecchainedto": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../../moves.rs/characterization/snapshots/scale-project/tables/db__movesexecution1ccc0232_campuscluster_illinois_edu__runspecchainedto.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_runspecchainedto"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope",
          "chain"
        ],
        "note": "0 rows: nothing in this run is chained.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_runspeccounty": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../../moves.rs/characterization/snapshots/scale-project/tables/db__movesexecution1ccc0232_campuscluster_illinois_edu__runspeccounty.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_runspeccounty"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope"
        ],
        "note": "1 row, countyID 26161: the project's host county. The project link is selected by it and road type 4, as every run's link is.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    }
  },
  "models": {
    "Onroad": {
      "ref": "../inputs/washtenaw-project.esm",
      "bindings": {
        "n_outputRate": 125
      }
    }
  }
}
